WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.856 --> 00:00:12.326
[WATER RUNNING]

00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:13.314
[SQUEAKING]

00:00:13.314 --> 00:00:15.682
[CHILD CRYING]

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.140
What we keep talking
about is, what

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:20.590
are scary, disturbing
sequences that we

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.060
can bring into the piece?

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.150
And the writers came up
with the hypnosis idea.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.731
Count down slowly from 100.

00:00:26.731 --> 00:00:31.880
99, 98, 97, 96--

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.530
If we did a hypnosis episode
where someone was put under,

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:37.827
we could get some more
nuggets about the cult, what

00:00:37.827 --> 00:00:39.410
they experienced.
And again, did

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:40.870
they experienced it
outside of the house.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.100
What did they experience?

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.180
You see a baby?

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.650
Does he have the baby?

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.640
He takes out of the eyes,
and he throws them away.

00:00:52.059 --> 00:00:54.030
[PHONE RINGING]

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.260
Yeah?

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.440
Why is she looking for me?

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:00.750
Everything in this show
is an interpretation.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.330
We represent supernatural
by insinuation,

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.880
which is my favorite
way of telling stories.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:06.750
You just insinuate.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.240
You never actually
see the shark.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:13.925
It's just "movement in
the water" kind of thing.

00:01:13.925 --> 00:01:16.390
[SQUEAKING]

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:21.600
Why haven't you told
her what she did?

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.650
[MUSIC PLAYING]

